ent\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Skip segment\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2\">Skip segment</button><button data-name=\"Choose next\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Choose next\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-3\">Choose next</button></div></div></div><div data-name=\"End tracking confirmation\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#1B1F27] p-5 flex-1 min-h-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[26px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\">End LiveLift tracking?</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-3 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2\">This stops LiveLift tracking. It does not stop your platform broadcast.</p><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"flex gap-4 mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3\"><button data-name=\"Keep operating\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#DFFF00] text-[#111407] hover:bg-[#CBEA00]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Keep operating\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-1\">Keep operating</button><button data-name=\"End tracking\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"End tracking\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2\">End tracking</button></div><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-4\">If the outcome is unknown, remain here while checking. Review opens only after the ending state is acknowledged.</p></div></div></div>",
